        "headline": "Special Weather Statement issued November 13 at 1:58AM PST by NWS Pendleton OR",
        "description": "Areas of dense fog have been observed along the Columbia Basin of\nWashington including but not limited to: Interstate 82, WA-240.\nand Route 395. Within fog, visibilities as low as one-half mile\nare expected to persist through the overnight. Use extra caution\nwhile traveling as visibility can change quickly. If fog is\nencountered, use low-beam headlights and keep plenty of space\nbetween you and other vehicles.",
